title Monitoring & Ticketing Infrastructure
direction right

System Administrator [icon: user]
End User [icon: user]
Slack [icon: signal]

CLOUD-PROVIDER {
  REGION {
    VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {
      IGW [icon: aws-internet-gateway]

      Bastion Host {
        SSH Server [icon: debian]
      }

      DMZ {
        Reverse Proxy Server [icon: nginx]
      }

      Private Subnet [color: purple, textSize: medium] {

        Zabbix Monitoring Server [icon: debian, color: green] {
          Zabbix Server [icon: server]
          Apache Frontend [icon: apache]
          MariaDB Database [icon: MariaDB]
        }

        Zammad Ticketing Server [color: blue, textSize: medium, icon: DOCKER] {
          Nginx Reverse Proxy [icon: nginx]
          Rails Server [icon: server]
          Scheduler [icon: server]
          Websocket Server [icon: server]
          POSTGRESQL [icon: sql-server, label: PostgreSQL]
          Redis [icon: Redis]
          ELASTICSEARCH [icon: elasticsearch]
          Memcached [icon: server]
          Init Service [icon: server]
        }

        Linux Client [icon: debian]{
        Zabbix Agent 2_1_1 [label: Zabbix Agent 2, icon: agent]
        }
        Windows Client [icon: windows]{
        Zabbix Agent 2_1 [icon: agent, label: Zabbix Agent 2]
        }

        Docker Environment [textSize: medium, color: orange] {
          API Gateway [icon: docker]{
          }
          Container 1 [icon: docker]
          Container 2 [icon: docker]
          Zabbix Agent 2 [icon: agent]
        }
      }
      "NAT / PAT" [shape: rectangle, icon: gateway]
    }
  }
}

// Accès admin & utilisateurs
System Administrator > IGW: SSH 22
"NAT / PAT" > SSH Server: SSH 22
SSH Server > Private Subnet: SSH 22 / RDP 3389
System Administrator > IGW: HTTPS 443
"NAT / PAT" > Reverse Proxy Server: HTTPS 443
Reverse Proxy Server > Apache Frontend: HTTP 8080
Reverse Proxy Server > Nginx Reverse Proxy: HTTP 8080

// Zabbix interne
Apache Frontend <> Zabbix Server: local
Zabbix Server <> MariaDB Database: socket

// Alertes
Slack < IGW: TCP 443 (Websocket)
Slack > End User: HTTPS 443

// Agents

// Zammad interne
Nginx Reverse Proxy <> Rails Server: HTTP 3000
Nginx Reverse Proxy <> Websocket Server: WebSocket 6042
Rails Server <> POSTGRESQL: TCP 5432
Scheduler <> POSTGRESQL: TCP 5432
Rails Server <> Redis: TCP 6379
Scheduler <> Redis: TCP 6379
Websocket Server <> Redis: TCP 6379
Rails Server <> ELASTICSEARCH: TCP 9200
Scheduler <> ELASTICSEARCH: TCP 9200
Rails Server <> Memcached: TCP 11211
Scheduler <> Memcached: TCP 11211
Zabbix Server > Zammad Ticketing Server: HTTP 8080 (Webhook)

// Docker
System Administrator > IGW: SSH 22
System Administrator > IGW: HTTPS 443
        API Gateway > Container 1
        API Gateway > Container 2
Slack > System Administrator: HTTPS 443
