Zabbix Server <> Windows Client: TCP 10050/51
Zabbix Server <> Linux Client: TCP 10050/51
Zabbix Server > IGW: H
Zabbix Server > IGW: HTTP 8080 (Webhook)
Zabbix Server > IGW: HTTP 8080 (Webhook)
